## 🔍 Phase 3: Purple Team Verification (Re-Testing Controls)
**Goal:** Re-run reconnaissance from Kali (`192.168.56.101`) against `Win-DC01` (`192.168.56.10`) to confirm the anonymous enumeration remediation worked.

1. **Re-Run SMB Null Session Check (Kali):**
   ```bash
   netexec smb 192.168.56.10 -u '' -p '' --shares
   ```
   * **Expected Result:** Anonymous logon (`[+] Company.local\:`) should now be rejected (`STATUS_ACCESS_DENIED` or `STATUS_LOGON_FAILURE`).

